  - m_Id: 15044556432072932
    m_Localized: Once operational, the warehouse provides storage slots and a resource
      supply point. Upgrades improve slot types and capacity, while understaffing
      or failed maintenance increases material loss.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
